<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<figure id="A1.F10" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.26622v1/scaling_law_outdomain.svg" id="A1.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:384/169;" width="384" height="169"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span> Fitted scaling law on out-of-domain dataset (Paloma). The scaling behavior is consistent with the in-domain evaluation.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F11" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.26622v1/training_loss.svg" id="A1.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:439/173;" width="439" height="173"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span> Pretraining loss curve. Note the loss is not directly comparable between RedLLM and DecLLM due to their difference in pretraining objective.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F12" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.26622v1/context_length_out_domain.svg" id="A1.F12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/134;" width="548" height="134"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span> PPL curves for length extrapolation on out-of-domain dataset (Paloma). The extrapolation result is consistent with the in-domain evaluation.</figcaption>
</figure>
